<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <record id="page_services" model="website.page">
        <field name="name">SERVICES</field>
        <field name="type">qweb</field>
        <field name="url">/services</field>
        <field name="key">website_adipack.page_services</field>
        <field name="is_published" eval="True"/>
        <field name="adipack_english" eval="True"/>
        <field name="website_meta_title">SERVICES | Adipack - Adinox</field>
        <field name="arch" type="xml"><t t-name="website_adipack.page_services"><t t-call="website.layout"><div id="wrap" class="oe_structure oe_empty"><section class="o_adp_section o_adp_slider_section o_colored_level" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="Slider"><div class="container-fluid px-0"><div class="mx-auto" style="max-width: 1332px"><div id="o_adp_carousel_services_1" class="carousel slide o_adp_carousel o_adp_revslider" data-bs-ride="carousel" data-bs-interval="6000"><div class="carousel-inner"><div class="carousel-item active"><img class="d-block w-100 img-fluid" src="/website_adipack/static/src/uploads/2017/04/calidad-innovacion-confianza.png" alt="Slide"/></div><div class="carousel-item"><img class="d-block w-100 img-fluid" src="/website_adipack/static/src/uploads/2017/06/banners-servicios-5.jpg" alt="Slide"/></div></div><button class="carousel-control-prev" type="button" data-bs-target="#o_adp_carousel_services_1" data-bs-slide="prev"><span class="carousel-control-prev-icon" aria-hidden="true"/><span class="visually-hidden">Anterior</span></button><button class="carousel-control-next" type="button" data-bs-target="#o_adp_carousel_services_1" data-bs-slide="next"><span class="carousel-control-next-icon" aria-hidden="true"/><span class="visually-hidden">Siguiente</span></button></div></div></div></section><section class="o_adp_section o_colored_level" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="Bloque"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="o_colored_level col-12 col-lg-8"><div class="o_adp_text "><p>For Adipack, the service is a fundamental part of the company and of what we offer. Our main commitment is to guarantee a variety of services that cover each of the aspects of your production, providing personalized support in each of our services, improving your productivity and performance.</p></div><div class="s_accordion o_adp_accordion" data-snippet="s_accordion" data-name="Accordion"><div id="o_adp_acc_services_2" class="accordion"><div class="accordion-item position-relative z-1" data-name="Accordion Item"><button type="button" id="o_adp_acc_services_2_b0" class="accordion-header accordion-button justify-content-between gap-2 bg-transparent h6-fs fw-bold text-decoration-none text-reset transition-none" data-bs-target="#o_adp_acc_services_2_t0" aria-controls="o_adp_acc_services_2_t0" data-bs-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="true"><span class="flex-grow-1">After-sales support</span></button><div id="o_adp_acc_services_2_t0" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#o_adp_acc_services_2" role="region" aria-labelledby="o_adp_acc_services_2_b0"><div class="accordion-body"><p>From the commercial department we take care of receiving your queries or requirements. We send technical information and make offers that meet your needs. Supported by a group of trained and experienced people to guarantee the best technical assistance and information of our equipment.</p></div></div></div><div class="accordion-item position-relative z-1" data-name="Accordion Item"><button type="button" id="o_adp_acc_services_2_b1" class="accordion-header accordion-button collapsed justify-content-between gap-2 bg-transparent h6-fs fw-bold text-decoration-none text-reset transition-none" data-bs-target="#o_adp_acc_services_2_t1" aria-controls="o_adp_acc_services_2_t1" data-bs-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false"><span class="flex-grow-1">Spare parts</span></button><div id="o_adp_acc_services_2_t1" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#o_adp_acc_services_2" role="region" aria-labelledby="o_adp_acc_services_2_b1"><div class="accordion-body"><p>We provide the necessary spare parts for the proper functioning of the equipment as soon as possible. </p>
<p>The parts we offer are exactly the same ones we use when manufacturing the machines, so they adapt perfectly to your machine.</p>
<p>We guarantee original parts of high quality to achieve the best performance in production.</p>
<p>Adipack spare parts provide:<br/>
1. Quality<br/>
2. Trust<br/>
3. Security</p></div></div></div><div class="accordion-item position-relative z-1" data-name="Accordion Item"><button type="button" id="o_adp_acc_services_2_b2" class="accordion-header accordion-button collapsed justify-content-between gap-2 bg-transparent h6-fs fw-bold text-decoration-none text-reset transition-none" data-bs-target="#o_adp_acc_services_2_t2" aria-controls="o_adp_acc_services_2_t2" data-bs-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false"><span class="flex-grow-1">Maintenance service</span></button><div id="o_adp_acc_services_2_t2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#o_adp_acc_services_2" role="region" aria-labelledby="o_adp_acc_services_2_b2"><div class="accordion-body"><p>Our commitment is to guarantee that the machines of our clients are in perfect operation, for this reason we have a team of expert technicians to provide support directly in the client’s factory where they make an adequate forecast and an adequate solution with the support of the manufacturer, guaranteeing this way greater performance in their equipment and a reliable technical service.</p></div></div></div><div class="accordion-item position-relative z-1" data-name="Accordion Item"><button type="button" id="o_adp_acc_services_2_b3" class="accordion-header accordion-button collapsed justify-content-between gap-2 bg-transparent h6-fs fw-bold text-decoration-none text-reset transition-none" data-bs-target="#o_adp_acc_services_2_t3" aria-controls="o_adp_acc_services_2_t3" data-bs-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false"><span class="flex-grow-1">Installation Service</span></button><div id="o_adp_acc_services_2_t3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#o_adp_acc_services_2" role="region" aria-labelledby="o_adp_acc_services_2_b3"><div class="accordion-body"><p>Once the machine arrives at the client’s facilities, our team of technicians perform technical assistance in installation and starting of the machine, guaranteeing a good functioning and performance. </p>
<p>The installation service comprises two parts:<br/>
1. Mechanical installation: includes the adaptation of the facilities and the assembly of the parts that make up the machine.<br/>
2. Electrical-electronic installation: operation of all electrical and control equipment, installation of keypads, screens and wiring.</p></div></div></div><div class="accordion-item position-relative z-1" data-name="Accordion Item"><button type="button" id="o_adp_acc_services_2_b4" class="accordion-header accordion-button collapsed justify-content-between gap-2 bg-transparent h6-fs fw-bold text-decoration-none text-reset transition-none" data-bs-target="#o_adp_acc_services_2_t4" aria-controls="o_adp_acc_services_2_t4" data-bs-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false"><span class="flex-grow-1">Training</span></button><div id="o_adp_acc_services_2_t4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#o_adp_acc_services_2" role="region" aria-labelledby="o_adp_acc_services_2_b4"><div class="accordion-body"><p>To guarantee the good functioning and optimal handling of the equipment, we offer a customized training program to the designated personnel at no cost, thanks to our expert staff in the area.</p></div></div></div><div class="accordion-item position-relative z-1" data-name="Accordion Item"><button type="button" id="o_adp_acc_services_2_b5" class="accordion-header accordion-button collapsed justify-content-between gap-2 bg-transparent h6-fs fw-bold text-decoration-none text-reset transition-none" data-bs-target="#o_adp_acc_services_2_t5" aria-controls="o_adp_acc_services_2_t5" data-bs-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false"><span class="flex-grow-1">Remote Technical Support</span></button><div id="o_adp_acc_services_2_t5" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#o_adp_acc_services_2" role="region" aria-labelledby="o_adp_acc_services_2_b5"><div class="accordion-body"><p>Adipack has the best technology, which allows to provide you remote support without having to go to your facilities. In this way we guarantee a quick and effective solution to your needs.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="o_colored_level col-12 col-lg-3"><div class="o_adp_image text-center" style="margin-bottom: 10px"><img class="img-fluid" src="/website_adipack/static/src/uploads/2017/04/diseno-adipack.jpg" alt="lider en el diseño y fabricacion de maquinaria para la industria alimenticia" width="384"/></div><div class="o_adp_image text-center" style="margin-bottom: 12px"><img class="img-fluid" src="/website_adipack/static/src/uploads/2017/04/repuestos-adipack.jpg" alt="Repuestos Adipack" width="384"/></div><div class="o_adp_image text-center" style="margin-bottom: 20px"><img class="img-fluid" src="/website_adipack/static/src/uploads/2017/04/envasadoras-asepticas-servicio03.png" alt="mantenimiento de envasadoras asepticas" width="385"/></div></div></div></div></section><section class="o_adp_section o_colored_level" style="padding: 8px 0px 0px 130px" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="Bloque"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="o_colored_level col-12 col-lg-12"><div class="o_adp_title " style="margin-bottom: 20px"><h3 style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; font-style: italic; text-transform: none; color: #00437a">Why choose Adipack services?</h3></div></div><div class="o_colored_level col-12 col-lg-12 o_adp_w20"><div class="o_adp_image text-center" style="margin-bottom: 20px"><img class="img-fluid" src="/website_adipack/static/src/uploads/2017/04/iconos-adipack-08.png" alt="Adipack" width="1124"/></div></div><div class="o_colored_level col-12 col-lg-12 o_adp_w20"><div class="o_adp_image text-center" style="margin-bottom: 20px"><img class="img-fluid" src="/website_adipack/static/src/uploads/2017/04/iconos-adipack-10.png" alt="Adipack" width="997"/></div></div><div class="o_colored_level col-12 col-lg-2"><div class="o_adp_image text-center" style="margin-bottom: 20px"><img class="img-fluid" src="/website_adipack/static/src/uploads/2017/04/iconos-ventajas-adipack-05.png" alt="Adipack" width="896"/></div></div><div class="o_colored_level col-12 col-lg-12 o_adp_w20"><div class="o_adp_image text-center" style="margin-bottom: 20px"><img class="img-fluid" src="/website_adipack/static/src/uploads/2017/04/iconos-adipack-09.png" alt="Adipack" width="1033"/></div></div></div></div></section><section class="o_adp_section o_colored_level" style="padding: 8px 0px 0px 130px" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="Bloque"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="o_colored_level col-12 col-lg-12 o_adp_w20"><div class="o_adp_image text-center" style="margin-bottom: 20px"><img class="img-fluid" src="/website_adipack/static/src/uploads/2017/04/soldador2-adipack.jpg" alt="Adipack" width="384"/></div></div><div class="o_colored_level col-12 col-lg-12 o_adp_w20"><div class="o_adp_image text-center" style="margin-bottom: 20px"><img class="img-fluid" src="/website_adipack/static/src/uploads/2017/04/soldador-adipack.jpg" alt="Adipack" width="384"/></div></div><div class="o_colored_level col-12 col-lg-12 o_adp_w20"><div class="o_adp_image text-center" style="margin-bottom: 20px"><img class="img-fluid" src="/website_adipack/static/src/uploads/2017/04/mantenimiento-repuesto-adipack.jpg" alt="mantenimiento o repuestos de maquinaria adipack" width="384"/></div></div><div class="o_colored_level col-12 col-lg-12 o_adp_w20"><div class="o_adp_image text-center" style="margin-bottom: 20px"><img class="img-fluid" src="/website_adipack/static/src/uploads/2017/04/reaparacion-adipack.jpg" alt="Reparación Adipack" width="384"/></div></div></div></div></section></div></t></t></field>
